{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"高阶关系范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"高阶关系范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>高阶关系范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"关系2-范畴","text":"关系 $2$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"的推广. 设 $\\mathcal C$ 是有拉回的范畴, 其关系 $2$-范畴 $\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)$ 的对象为 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)}(X,Y) = \\{X \\leftarrow Z \\to Y\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>归纳地定义<strong>关系 $n$-范畴</strong> ($n$-category of correspondences) $n\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)$ ($n\\geq 2$): 其对象仍为 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{n\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)}(X,Y) = (n-1)\\mathsf{Corr}(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)}(X,Y)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>约定 $1\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)= \\mathcal C$.</p>\n"}]}}